在许多其他领域也是如此。

308
00:16:13,840 --> 00:16:17,360
So, as mentioned before, some of the ways of thinking
所以，如前所述，一些思维方式

309
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:19,200
that were pioneered by the internet
这些是由互联网开创的。

310
00:16:19,200 --> 00:16:21,040
and now used all over the place,
而现在到处都在使用，

311
00:16:21,040 --> 00:16:23,680
we already saw earlier, there is no theoretical model,
我们之前已经看到，没有理论模型，

312
00:16:23,680 --> 00:16:26,560
there's no benchmark, there is no target you can hit
没有基准，也没有你可以达成的目标。

313
00:16:26,560 --> 00:16:29,440
or way that you can prove that things are working.
或者你可以证明事情正在运作的方式。

314
00:16:29,440 --> 00:16:30,800
So, there actually is no sense
所以，实际上毫无意义

315
00:16:30,800 --> 00:16:32,720
