00:16:37,600 --> 00:16:40,480
but it balances lots of different goals very well.
但它很好地平衡了许多不同的目标。

319
00:16:40,480 --> 00:16:44,400
So, we say it works well, even though I cannot prove to you
所以，我们说它运作良好，尽管我无法向你证明

320
00:16:44,400 --> 00:16:48,240
