连接到将整个世界联系在一起的事物。

417
00:20:34,640 --> 00:20:36,000
And along the way,
而在此过程中，

418
00:20:36,080 --> 00:20:37,600
I'll use the postal analogy,
我将用邮政系统来打个比方，

419
00:20:37,600 --> 00:20:42,080
because I think it bears a lot of similarities to the internet.
因为我认为它与互联网有许多相似之处。

420
00:20:42,080 --> 00:20:43,360
So, the first thing I need,
那么，我首先需要的，

421
00:20:43,360 --> 00:20:46,320
if I want to allow people to communicate,
如果我想让人们能够交流，

422
00:20:46,320 --> 00:20:50,720
I need some way to move data from point A to point B.
我需要某种方式将数据从A点移动到B点。

423
00:20:50,720 --> 00:20:53,680
That's the most basic thing I could possibly ask for.
那是我可能要求的最基本的东西。

424
00:20:53,680 --> 00:20:56,240
Some technology that takes data at point A
某种技术能在点A处获取数据

425
00:20:56,240 --> 00:20:58,000
and moves it to point B.
并将其移动到B点。

426
00:20:58,000 --> 00:20:59,680
And this could be anything you want.
而这可以是任何你想要的东西。

427
00:20:59,680 --> 00:21:03,040
So, in the postal analogy, this could be a mailman
那么，在邮政的类比中，这可能是一位邮递员

428
00:21:03,120 --> 00:21:05,760
walking on the streets and carrying your letters
走在街上，带着你的信

429
00:21:05,760 --> 00:21:07,280
from point A to point B.
从点A到点B。

430
00:21:07,280 --> 00:21:08,720
It could be the pony express.
可能是小马快递。

431
00:21:08,720 --> 00:21:11,760
Like, you put the bag of mail on the rider,
就像，你把那袋邮件放在骑手身上，

432
00:21:11,760 --> 00:21:12,880
they get on the horse,
他们骑上马，

433
00:21:12,880 --> 00:21:16,080
and they ride across the wild west to deliver your mail.
他们驰骋在狂野西部，为你递送邮件。

434
00:21:16,080 --> 00:21:17,120
It could be a carrier pigeon.
它可能是一只信鸽。

435
00:21:17,120 --> 00:21:18,800
Like, you tie the mail to the pigeon,
